WEBVTT

00:14.590 --> 00:15.520
Yes?

00:16.310 --> 00:19.620
I'm here to pick you up, Aijo-sama.

00:20.340 --> 00:23.000
Good morning, Meido-san.

00:39.730 --> 00:44.940
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

00:45.770 --> 00:48.610
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

00:48.610 --> 00:50.900
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

00:50.900 --> 00:52.490
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

00:52.490 --> 00:53.740
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

00:53.740 --> 00:55.240
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

00:56.410 --> 00:58.950
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

00:58.950 --> 01:01.370
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

01:01.370 --> 01:03.670
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

01:03.670 --> 01:04.330
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

01:04.330 --> 01:05.000
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

01:05.000 --> 01:06.540
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

01:06.670 --> 01:11.380
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

01:14.130 --> 01:15.800
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

01:21.430 --> 01:23.480
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

02:01.730 --> 02:06.640
Aijo-sama, will you please go out with me?

02:07.010 --> 02:09.020
That's a little bit out of the blue.

02:09.490 --> 02:14.820
Oh, I know. How about you act
as his personal maid tomorrow?

02:15.250 --> 02:20.320
Hahari-san gave me this golden opportunity.
I must get to know her better.

02:20.320 --> 02:23.510
Where to today?

02:23.510 --> 02:24.580
Well...

02:24.580 --> 02:28.710
What do you like?
Any hobbies, things you're into?

02:28.710 --> 02:31.640
I'd like to go somewhere
we can take them in.

02:32.970 --> 02:35.210
What do I like?

02:36.300 --> 02:39.620
Well, I love Hahari-sama.

02:40.480 --> 02:43.760
Then I'll take us to
the Hanazono family residence.

02:44.100 --> 02:47.290
Stop! Anything other than that!

02:49.060 --> 02:50.980
Other than Hahari-sama? Well...

02:51.400 --> 02:54.300
Yeah? What else?

02:54.300 --> 02:55.390
Um...

02:56.260 --> 03:00.490
If I may be so forward, I love you.

03:00.880 --> 03:04.180
Then I'll take us to your home.

03:04.180 --> 03:05.900
Return to sender?!

03:08.820 --> 03:11.260
Wh-What else?

03:11.260 --> 03:14.780
I'm sorry. I can't think of anything else.

03:14.780 --> 03:15.580
Huh?

03:15.580 --> 03:19.760
What about your favorite foods,
activities, or places? Nothing?

03:20.750 --> 03:22.430
I'm terribly sorry.

03:22.430 --> 03:24.510
I-It's fine!

03:25.850 --> 03:27.770
In that case...

03:41.740 --> 03:44.090
We should get some lunch.

03:44.090 --> 03:47.280
They have food stalls here.
Is there anything you want to eat?

03:47.280 --> 03:51.910
Please, pay me no mind.
What would you like?

03:52.290 --> 03:56.590
Hmm... She's just gonna end up
trying to please me all day.

03:56.590 --> 03:57.540
Oh, I know!

03:58.420 --> 04:01.280
I'd like you to cook something for me.

04:01.280 --> 04:02.210
What?

04:02.320 --> 04:06.540
She can't cook out here,
so she can't fulfill my wish.

04:06.540 --> 04:10.560
Which means we'll have to find middle
ground with what she wants to eat.

04:11.130 --> 04:12.580
Your wish is my command.

04:12.580 --> 04:14.060
It doesn't have to be!

04:14.060 --> 04:15.620
Please wait one moment.

04:15.620 --> 04:18.600
Uh... I'm starving, you see!

04:18.600 --> 04:22.300
Please bring me food right away...
w-within one minute!

04:22.720 --> 04:24.060
Your wish is my command.

04:24.060 --> 04:25.570
But it's not!

04:26.920 --> 04:29.640
Here you are. My homecooked lunch.

04:29.640 --> 04:31.830
Did you use a time machine?!

04:32.130 --> 04:35.080
No, this meal doesn't
contain any time machines.

04:35.080 --> 04:37.520
Not what I meant!

04:37.520 --> 04:39.340
How did you prepare this?

04:39.810 --> 04:42.140
W-Well, um...

04:43.240 --> 04:47.940
I got too excited
and prepared it this morning.

04:47.940 --> 04:51.220
I apologize if this was
an unwelcome gesture.

04:51.570 --> 04:52.420
Huh?

04:52.420 --> 04:57.860
And yet, she was going to keep it hidden
and let me eat whatever I wanted.

04:58.380 --> 05:01.890
So humble, so selfless!

05:01.890 --> 05:03.690
A model maid!

05:07.870 --> 05:12.750
Yum, this is delicious!
So many egg dishes, too.

05:13.150 --> 05:16.120
They're my favorite, actually.

05:16.120 --> 05:18.120
I-I know...

05:18.120 --> 05:21.210
I asked Hahari-sama about it.

05:21.540 --> 05:24.720
Again, such hospitality, such benefits!

05:25.800 --> 05:29.130
Thank you. That was really great.

05:29.130 --> 05:31.260
I'm glad it was to your taste.

05:33.470 --> 05:36.020
Today's such a perfect day.
The sakura blossoms, the weather...

05:39.210 --> 05:40.720
Is something the matter?

05:40.720 --> 05:41.650
Huh?

05:42.230 --> 05:45.130
I don't know...
You just seem a little restless.

05:45.130 --> 05:47.240
N-No, I wouldn't say I am.

05:47.520 --> 05:50.860
Come on, what is it? Tell me.

05:52.500 --> 05:54.240
As you wish.

05:54.810 --> 05:57.960
I-If I may be so forward...

05:58.410 --> 06:01.000
Would you like to give me any orders?

06:01.000 --> 06:01.930
Huh?

06:02.280 --> 06:04.880
Anything you wish.

06:04.880 --> 06:06.630
Please, Aijo-sama...

06:06.630 --> 06:08.680
Allow me to serve you.

06:09.950 --> 06:12.840
When a strapping young lad

06:12.840 --> 06:17.390
is asked to give any order
he wishes to a woman like her,

06:17.390 --> 06:22.150
his mind is sure to be filled with all sorts
of desires before he even has to think!

06:24.230 --> 06:27.690
Order her? What in the world
am I supposed to make her do?!

06:27.690 --> 06:32.780
But, of course, this is Aijo Rentaro
we're talking about.

06:33.130 --> 06:36.220
Here's a diagram of
what his mind probably looks like.

06:36.220 --> 06:37.540
Scary, huh?

06:38.610 --> 06:40.620
It's what Meido-san wants.

06:40.620 --> 06:43.290
I have to give her some kind of order.

06:44.660 --> 06:46.840
Well, in that case...

06:46.840 --> 06:49.670
I'd like to try holding that
sakura branch over there.

06:50.350 --> 06:52.120
As you wish!

06:56.920 --> 06:58.570
As you requested.

06:58.570 --> 07:00.260
Thank you.

07:01.580 --> 07:03.430
Something feels off.

07:04.250 --> 07:06.160
Right, I get it now.

07:06.570 --> 07:08.920
Which branch should I bring you next?

07:08.920 --> 07:10.700
This is fetch for dogs!

07:11.420 --> 07:15.120
Scumbags who treat women like dogs
deserve to die a thousand times—

07:16.500 --> 07:19.900
Okay, this time, throw the branch
as far as you can.

07:19.900 --> 07:22.250
Hm? As you wish.

07:29.020 --> 07:29.950
Here you go.

07:30.570 --> 07:32.100
Yeah, this is it.

07:32.100 --> 07:37.010
This way, I can give Meido-san orders
without treating her like a dog.

07:37.480 --> 07:39.600
Sorry... What are we doing here?

07:39.600 --> 07:41.890
No! She seems unsatisfied!

07:42.160 --> 07:47.590
Aijo-sama, please give me
a more substantive order.

07:47.590 --> 07:51.530
Allow me to serve you better.

07:51.530 --> 07:56.220
Meido-san? Why are you
so intent on serving others?

07:56.660 --> 08:00.700
I must admit it's quite admirable,
but you should treat yourself better.

08:00.700 --> 08:01.630
No.

08:04.350 --> 08:08.550
I am not worth it.

08:17.490 --> 08:20.280
Hahari-sama and you...

08:20.280 --> 08:25.560
My only purpose and value
comes from serving my dear masters.

08:26.750 --> 08:28.180
That's just...

08:30.350 --> 08:34.260
I understand. I'm going to
give just this one order.

08:34.260 --> 08:35.470
Anything you please!

08:36.280 --> 08:39.700
Starting now, you are not allowed
to be of any use to me.

08:42.760 --> 08:47.610
I can't be of any use? That's your order?

08:47.610 --> 08:50.370
Yep. Please see to it.

08:50.370 --> 08:52.090
As you wish.

08:54.840 --> 08:55.870
Hey, uh...

08:56.750 --> 09:00.430
You're being too cute
sitting around like that.

09:00.430 --> 09:01.450
Huh?

09:01.450 --> 09:05.850
You're soothing my soul,
which means you're being of use to me.

09:06.130 --> 09:07.980
M-My apologies.

09:10.460 --> 09:15.120
Hey, uh... You're being too lovable
standing around like that.

09:15.120 --> 09:17.360
M-My apologies.

09:17.660 --> 09:19.870
I must remove myself from his sight.

09:21.050 --> 09:22.120
Hey, uh...

09:22.410 --> 09:25.740
You're making me relax
by watching my back.

09:25.740 --> 09:26.750
What?

09:27.090 --> 09:28.250
Then...

09:30.180 --> 09:31.110
Hey, uh...

09:31.300 --> 09:34.920
You're comforting me
by keeping watch from afar.

09:34.920 --> 09:36.760
What? Then...

09:37.660 --> 09:38.380
Glance.

09:38.380 --> 09:40.890
Oh no, now you're just being cute.

09:41.960 --> 09:43.890
I-I'm left with no choice.

09:46.890 --> 09:48.270
(Parenting Bible
Kitten Club)

09:48.310 --> 09:49.270
Oh?

09:49.570 --> 09:53.700
Why are you here, Meido?
Aren't you Rentaro-chan's maid for the day?

09:53.700 --> 09:57.280
I'm currently following
Aijo-sama's orders.

09:57.570 --> 09:58.500
Huh?

10:03.070 --> 10:04.320
Hello?

10:05.930 --> 10:08.110
For you, Meido.

10:08.110 --> 10:09.210
Okay.

10:09.830 --> 10:13.800
Hello. This is Meido speaking.

10:13.800 --> 10:17.920
Hey, uh... Imagining what you're up to
makes my heart race.

10:19.500 --> 10:24.600
N-No... I don't know
how to follow Aijo-sama's order...

10:25.050 --> 10:27.980
What in the world are you two up to?

10:28.260 --> 10:32.270
You shouldn't run away.
Go back to Rentaro-chan.

10:32.980 --> 10:35.520
A-As you wish...

10:36.980 --> 10:38.570
What do we do?

10:38.940 --> 10:43.290
You're not following my order at all.

10:43.290 --> 10:49.290
B-But... if I somehow end up being of use
to you whatever I do or wherever I go,

10:49.730 --> 10:53.620
there's only one way
I can stop being of use to you.

10:53.620 --> 10:55.920
And what is that?

10:57.110 --> 11:01.050
I must... end my very life.

11:05.790 --> 11:07.130
Exactly.

11:07.130 --> 11:08.060
Huh?

11:08.450 --> 11:11.340
The only way you wouldn't be
of any use to me is if you died.

11:11.780 --> 11:13.190
In other words...

11:13.680 --> 11:17.690
You're helping me just by existing.

11:18.110 --> 11:23.200
You don't have to follow my orders
or try to serve me.

11:23.820 --> 11:27.750
Just by being yourself, you are worthy.

11:31.960 --> 11:33.960
Hey! Are you all right?!

11:34.320 --> 11:36.980
I'll call an ambulance!
You're going to be okay!

11:37.780 --> 11:43.720
Why... must I survive?
My life is worthless.

11:44.060 --> 11:46.950
It has no purpose...

11:47.540 --> 11:49.140
You'll see someday.

11:49.140 --> 11:50.310
Huh?

11:50.700 --> 11:54.490
It may sometimes show in
the cruelest of ways,

11:54.490 --> 11:59.070
but no life is meaningless or worthless!

11:59.500 --> 12:02.260
I refuse to accept it!

12:04.440 --> 12:08.420
When you love someone,
you're grateful just for them being there.

12:08.930 --> 12:12.580
The mere fact that they're alive
is a blessing all on its own.

12:12.890 --> 12:16.700
Wait, what? Did you say... "love"?

12:16.700 --> 12:17.630
Right.

12:17.780 --> 12:20.200
I love you too, Meido-san!

12:20.200 --> 12:22.260
And I want to go out with you!

12:26.970 --> 12:28.600
Your wish is my command!

12:28.600 --> 12:30.380
That wasn't a command!

12:30.380 --> 12:34.040
If you must do anything for me,
do it as my girlfriend, not my maid.

12:34.040 --> 12:36.980
In return, I'll do anything for you
as your boyfriend.

12:36.980 --> 12:38.330
Your wish is my command.

12:38.330 --> 12:39.940
Listen to me!

12:41.560 --> 12:43.610
And there you have it.

12:44.060 --> 12:48.870
May I have your permission to welcome
Meido Mei-san as my newest girlfriend?

12:49.230 --> 12:50.430
All I'm getting is déjà vu.

12:50.430 --> 12:52.120
Knew this was gonna happen.

12:52.120 --> 12:55.490
Yay! Great to have ya, Mei!

12:55.490 --> 12:57.880
"It is a pleasure to
make thine acquaintance."

12:57.880 --> 12:59.870
Thank you for welcoming me.

12:59.870 --> 13:03.160
Since this is now a maid-girlfriend-
joins-the-crew episode,

13:03.160 --> 13:05.280
let's all get into these maid outfits!

13:05.280 --> 13:06.640
How'd we jump to that?

13:07.010 --> 13:08.760
I'm never wearing that crap.

13:09.090 --> 13:13.370
I bet you'd all look
so great in maid outfits...

13:15.230 --> 13:18.520
(Cuteness Bomb ♥)

13:20.370 --> 13:23.390
Welcome home, Dear Master.

13:23.390 --> 13:26.150
Oh, have I ever come home, my dear maids.

13:26.150 --> 13:30.490
Rawr! Moe-moe-kyun beam! Rat-a-tat!

13:31.790 --> 13:33.660
(snap snap)

13:34.000 --> 13:38.380
Kusuri-sama, you'll dirty your clothes
if you run around so much.

13:38.380 --> 13:44.100
True, the hem has so many layers of
white frills, it'd be easy to get them stained.

13:44.100 --> 13:47.510
"And yet the maid remains ever pristine."

13:47.840 --> 13:51.890
As a maid in service,
I must remain presentable at all times.

13:52.320 --> 13:57.890
But would you be able to stay clean even if
someone were trying to get you dirty?

13:58.220 --> 13:59.850
What do you mean?

13:59.850 --> 14:01.900
Why don't we run a little experiment?

14:02.220 --> 14:06.900
A maid shootout with water guns,
where you lose when you get your clothes wet.

14:07.380 --> 14:08.530
Also known as...

14:08.530 --> 14:10.820
a Super Soaked Maid Party!

14:10.820 --> 14:15.280
The winner gets a passionate
huggy-kissy from Rentaro-chan!

14:15.700 --> 14:18.180
Huh? W-Wait just one second!

14:18.180 --> 14:19.830
Never mind if you don't want to...

14:19.830 --> 14:23.320
How could I not want to get
huggy-kissy with every one of you?!

14:23.320 --> 14:24.590
That's that, then.

14:24.590 --> 14:28.380
N-Not that I care. I just hate losing.

14:28.380 --> 14:30.820
Water gun fight! This will be fun, aye!

14:30.820 --> 14:32.970
I'll arrange for the water guns.

14:33.550 --> 14:35.900
We will now begin the match.

14:36.730 --> 14:41.980
Allow me to explain! The maid shootout
must be refereed by a butler!

14:41.980 --> 14:44.110
...said Hahari just now.

14:49.470 --> 14:50.790
Start the game!

14:51.740 --> 14:54.240
Hmph! Whoever shoots first, wins!

14:58.330 --> 15:02.710
Ugh! She's using her knowledge of the maid
outfit's tendencies to evade my shots!

15:02.710 --> 15:05.090
She's not a pro for nothing!

15:05.090 --> 15:06.460
Pardon me.

15:11.760 --> 15:13.760
Checkmate.

15:13.760 --> 15:15.950
Another shot?! I can't dodge it!

15:15.950 --> 15:17.020
It's gonna graze me!

15:21.380 --> 15:25.490
That's my Karane-san!
I would've gotten hit one tittion percent!

15:25.490 --> 15:28.250
Oh yeah? I'll gun you down
if you've got such a death wish!

15:28.250 --> 15:29.650
Chance!

15:31.340 --> 15:33.200
Karane's out!

15:33.200 --> 15:35.600
Yay, I got her, aye!

15:35.600 --> 15:36.600
Wide open.

15:38.140 --> 15:39.960
Kusuri-senpai's out!

15:39.960 --> 15:42.460
Squee! Super soaked maids!

15:42.460 --> 15:44.210
W-Wow!

15:44.740 --> 15:48.220
We're in the timeline where getting soaked
triggers a screenshot moment!

15:49.710 --> 15:53.520
Hahari had a little maid,
whose clothes were wet and soaked!

15:53.520 --> 15:55.100
You're wide open too!

15:55.100 --> 15:56.030
Fetch!

15:56.420 --> 15:57.720
Gourmet bean bun!

15:58.050 --> 16:00.130
Who're you, Anpanman receiving a new face?

16:00.130 --> 16:00.750
There!

16:00.760 --> 16:01.850
- Must protect!
There!

16:02.930 --> 16:04.670
Kurumi's out!

16:04.670 --> 16:07.110
My face is wet. I've been weakened.

16:10.170 --> 16:10.940
I've got her.

16:10.940 --> 16:12.850
No you don't.

16:16.050 --> 16:18.300
The speed of the propelled water.

16:18.300 --> 16:19.830
The distance.

16:20.210 --> 16:21.520
Air resistance.

16:21.520 --> 16:22.830
Calculate the time of impact...

16:23.240 --> 16:24.190
and project!

16:29.310 --> 16:32.470
"They're in a whole different
series over there."

16:33.120 --> 16:36.380
Fighting a powerful foe is inefficient.

16:36.380 --> 16:38.260
I should find a different target.

16:42.150 --> 16:43.600
"Golly gee! Didn't see that comin'!"

16:45.230 --> 16:48.230
"Please leave."

16:48.620 --> 16:50.250
"Please leave."

16:50.250 --> 16:51.230
"Please..."

16:51.800 --> 16:54.240
Goodbye, Yoshimoto Shizuka.

16:59.340 --> 17:01.700
Wh-Why'd Nano-senpai get hit?

17:01.700 --> 17:05.000
Not even Nano was able to predict
where that shot would land.

17:05.370 --> 17:07.330
Because she didn't need to.

17:07.330 --> 17:09.000
What do you mean?

17:09.000 --> 17:12.130
That shot had already missed its target.

17:12.400 --> 17:14.930
It was one that Shizuka-chan
fired in the air randomly.

17:14.930 --> 17:17.470
Oh, and it just fell back down?

17:18.700 --> 17:20.550
Nano's out!

17:20.550 --> 17:21.690
An oversight.

17:21.690 --> 17:26.290
Wow, Shizuka-senpai. You beat Nano-senpai.

17:26.290 --> 17:28.100
"Heh. Was sheer dumb luck."

17:28.100 --> 17:30.200
Wait, why are you wet too?!

17:30.980 --> 17:34.740
She got hit by another
of her own shots, aye.

17:38.220 --> 17:40.080
Shizuka-chan's out!

17:42.450 --> 17:44.460
That leaves just...

17:44.460 --> 17:46.320
Stop right there, Mei-san.

17:47.460 --> 17:48.800
Hahari-sama?

17:49.980 --> 17:52.920
I'm sorry, Meido. I was caught unawares.

17:53.390 --> 17:57.620
Mother, turn around so I can
give you a hug from behind.

17:57.620 --> 17:59.680
Really? Hooray!

17:59.960 --> 18:04.960
I laid low during the start and waited
for the others to eliminate one another.

18:04.960 --> 18:07.360
In the end, I'd take out
Mei-san the pro maid

18:07.360 --> 18:11.690
and Mother, who I predicted she would
keep safe—the perfect plan!

18:12.100 --> 18:14.690
Now, Mei-san, take yourself out.

18:15.300 --> 18:18.170
Hahari-sama's safety always comes first.

18:18.670 --> 18:19.820
Stop that, Mei!

18:21.240 --> 18:25.330
A mistress that hurts her maid
is no mistress at all.

18:25.820 --> 18:28.830
You mustn't, Hahari-sama! Please don't!

18:34.590 --> 18:36.340
Hahari-sama!

18:50.100 --> 18:52.020
Hakari's out!

18:52.020 --> 18:53.860
Oh no, I'm all wet.

18:53.860 --> 18:56.400
Quit with the suggestive pose!

18:56.400 --> 18:58.990
Huh? Whatever could you be talking about?

18:59.320 --> 19:03.260
Please speak after you watch this
flashback cut of your own suggestive pose.

19:05.440 --> 19:08.420
Please hang in there, Hahari-sama.

19:08.420 --> 19:09.500
Mei...

19:09.500 --> 19:12.600
Go get your huggy-kiss.

19:12.600 --> 19:13.750
Hahari-sama!

19:13.750 --> 19:16.090
Which means the sole survivor is...

19:16.090 --> 19:19.380
Hang on. L-Look.

19:20.700 --> 19:23.640
Mei's super soaked too, aye!

19:24.040 --> 19:27.800
"She embraced the super soaked Hahari-san."

19:27.800 --> 19:30.140
So, no survivors?

19:30.510 --> 19:32.140
Everyone's out?

19:32.140 --> 19:35.380
No, that's not it. What this means is...

19:36.150 --> 19:39.690
Everyone wins! You all did great!

19:39.690 --> 19:44.560
I don't care what anyone says,
a cat can bark for all I care! You all win!

19:44.560 --> 19:46.540
Yay!

19:46.540 --> 19:48.480
Bark!

19:50.730 --> 19:53.920
And so all the super soaked maids...

20:06.070 --> 20:09.540
were presented with
the prize of a huggy-kissy.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.180
As a result,

20:12.690 --> 20:15.610
Rentaro also got super soaked.

20:18.570 --> 20:20.980
And these two got even more soaked.

20:21.740 --> 20:24.000
What an awful punchline!

20:24.780 --> 20:26.990
(Episode 16: "Super Soaked Maid Party")

21:57.860 --> 22:01.530
Y'know, Mei, why did you even
become Hahari's maid, of all people?

22:01.530 --> 22:02.380
Of all people?

22:02.380 --> 22:05.760
You see, there was
blah-blah, chatter-chatter...

22:05.760 --> 22:08.900
...and mumbo-jumbo happened for reasons.

22:08.900 --> 22:09.890
Gumbo?

22:10.170 --> 22:13.950
I can't believe her abusive and
mob-debt-riddled parents abandoned her,

22:13.950 --> 22:18.560
and she had to roam the streets all alone
until she nearly died! What a tragic past!

22:18.560 --> 22:21.190
None of those words belong in a romcom!

22:21.190 --> 22:24.840
You understood too much from
those blah-blahs and mumbo-jumbos.

22:24.840 --> 22:27.880
"And then Hahari-san saved you?"

22:27.880 --> 22:30.800
Playing the game of life
on Lunatic difficulty.

22:30.800 --> 22:32.580
What lies beyond hard mode...

22:32.580 --> 22:37.240
I talked to Hakari about wanting
to adopt her as my own child.

22:37.240 --> 22:39.670
I could never ask that of you.

22:40.230 --> 22:45.480
After all, my life has been yours
to use ever since you saved it.

22:45.480 --> 22:48.930
Come on. Stop thinking of it that way.

22:54.100 --> 22:58.430
We can trade our life for money,
but we can never buy a life with money.

22:58.760 --> 23:02.440
Being able to save you that night
gives me immense pride to this day.

23:03.080 --> 23:04.490
Hahari-san...

23:05.900 --> 23:10.700
There is one thing I've always
hoped to learn.

23:11.140 --> 23:15.360
Hahari-sama, why did you choose to help

23:15.360 --> 23:18.290
a complete stranger like me that night?

23:18.290 --> 23:21.460
Isn't that obvious?

23:24.710 --> 23:26.190
Because I thought you were cute.

23:26.190 --> 23:27.960
You shoulda taken that to your grave!

23:28.290 --> 23:30.290
Your words honor me!

23:30.290 --> 23:31.970
Like mistress, like maid! Both idiots!

23:34.040 --> 23:38.440
You know Mother is blah-blah,
mumbo-jumbo, which means?

23:38.440 --> 23:39.130
Huh?

23:39.130 --> 23:40.350
She's a moron?

23:41.480 --> 23:46.230
We have some runtime left. Let's get cozy.

23:46.510 --> 23:48.350
Never heard her make that noise!

23:48.350 --> 23:49.530
That's all, folks.
